  "description": "Though his mother was an Omega, the new transfer student’s build left no doubt—Seol Daeyoung looked every inch a dominant Alpha. To survive, Jaemin had spent his whole life pretending to be an Alpha, and from the start he despised Seol Daeyoung. That piercing gaze Daeyoung fixed on him was the first time Jaemin had ever felt the overwhelming force of an Alpha’s stare after realizing he was truly an Omega. Instead of an Alpha’s pheromones, Daeyoung only smelled faintly of cheap fabric softener. When Jaemin refused to shake his hand, Daeyoung simply rested it on Jaemin’s shoulder with a pat. From the very day they met at eighteen—when fists flew between them—Daeyoung never missed a chance to torment Jaemin. But now, five years later, their relationship is beginning to change…",
